WEBVTT

00:07:57.496 --> 00:08:01.496
or psychological disability that
prospective employers wrongly judge.

00:08:02.204 --> 00:08:05.538
And although it's illegal to discriminate
against people with disabilities,

00:08:05.538 --> 00:08:09.038
employers have biases. In
a series of studies,

00:08:09.246 --> 00:08:12.788
people with disabilities were rated more
favorably if they brought them up at

00:08:12.788 --> 00:08:15.621
the beginning of an interview rather
than waiting until the end

00:08:15.663 --> 00:08:17.038
or concealing them altogether.

00:08:17.704 --> 00:08:20.079
Psychologist find that in
the face of setbacks,

00:08:20.079 --> 00:08:23.079
taking charge of the narrative doesn't
just signal to others that you're in

00:08:23.079 --> 00:08:26.829
control. Forming a story can also
boost your own motivation

00:08:27.038 --> 00:08:30.454
and build your confidence to overcome
past struggles and move forward in